notes.body:
@alagoutte what it the best way to change display field in the above structures? I would like to handle case when the flags fields can be 2 or 3 bytes long. If I define fields with the assumption that the field is 2 byte long, when it is 3 bytes long display field shall be 24 not 16 otherwise 8 "dots" for two first bytes are not displayed.
The easiest would be to create duplicate entries for 2 and/or 3 bytes in hf structure.

